# Exclude go workspace files - these are for local development only.
# Docker builds that need workspaces (e.g., market-data-sync) create their own.
go.work
go.work.sum

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only bulk. EVERY image built from this directory pays for these, because
# the daemon uploads the whole context before the first instruction runs.
#
# Measured 2026-07-26 while adding influence-collector/Dockerfile: the context
# was 1.94GB and took ~12 minutes to transfer, which reads as a hung build.
# Breakdown: enrichment-processor/venv 1.1GB, report-extractor/.venv 286MB,
# data/shorts 220MB, mobile_sam.pt 39MB, models/ 37MB.
#
# None of it is reachable from any Dockerfile: enrichment-processor DOWNLOADS
# mobile_sam.pt from GitHub at build time rather than copying it from context,
# and no Dockerfile COPYs data/ or a venv.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python virtualenvs (local dev only; images pip install from requirements.txt)
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Model weights — fetched at build time or at runtime, never from context
**/models/
*.pt
*.pb

# Sample/ingest CSV corpora
data/

# Local build outputs and credential helpers
bin/
docker-credential-gcr

# Local crawl artifacts. These can hold register/portal documents that must never
# be baked into an image (same rule as the housing crawl's CRAWL_TRACE output).
*.pdf
